# NOTE: do NOT add bare sram_w16*/sram_128b*/sram_160b* here.
# Those are the course's own behavioral SRAM models (plain .v source the design
# needs to compile). PDK SRAM macro views are covered by the extension rules
# above (.lib/.lef/.db/.gds), so blocking the .v by name only broke the build.

